    "description": "Agent Plugins v1.0.0 standardizes just 2 component types across 7 clients. What the portable core fixes, what it defers, and why Claude Code is missing.",
    "excerpt": "A read-through of the Agent Plugins v1.0.0 specification from the perspective of someone who already maintains plugins that ship two manifests to do one job. I publish a plugin called subagent-fleet. It contains exactly three skills and nothing else — no hooks, no commands, no…",
