    "excerpt": "This site used to have a standalone /ask page — a Q&A box bolted onto the nav, backed by OpenRouter and a hand-rolled retrieval layer. It worked, but it was a destination nobody visited on purpose. So I tore it out and put the same idea where people actually are: the homepage…",
